  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nSea views to the East and Marina views to the West, upstairs living to make most of the views.\r\n4 bedrooms, a lounge for the adults and a lounge for the children, a games room for all, double garage, and large office.\r\nThere is plenty of room on site for a spa and pool.\r\nPiece of mind with community security gates.\r\nJust enjoy.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
